11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"sm-mb-50 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__commonbanner2","style":{"--bg":"url(/_next/static/media/wireframing-banner.d69c62f2.webp) no-repeat center center / cover"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-10 sm-px-20 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__content","children":[["$","h2",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Wireframing and Prototyping Services Dubai</br> for Seamless Digital Experiences"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-30","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"WD Agency transforms ideas into interactive blueprints and prototypes that guide </br>flawless development. We are the Dubai’s leading UI/UX design agency."}}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/contact-us","className":"blue-btn","children":"Get a Free Consultation"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"We Visualize, Validate, and Optimize Before Development"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":" <p>Wireframing and prototyping are the necessary stages of digital product design through which companies plan user flows, interactions, and functionalities prior to the commencement of coding. At WD Agency, we deliver prototypes that are not only clear and interactive but also realistic to make sure that your website or app meets users’ expectations and achieves business goals.</p>\n                    <p>By conceptualizing your idea our team recognizes potential design problems, works out the navigation, and confirms that every element has its function. Wireframes are your digital product's skeleton, they show the layout, the hierarchy, and the areas of content, while prototypes turn them alive with the simulated interactions that directly refer to the final user experience.</p>\n                    "}}],["$","$L7",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/website-ux-design-1.cb063aa8.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/website-ux-design-2.aef52a7a.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>Wireframes and prototypes we produce for you are the stepping stones between the idea and the actual work, be it for a new digital product or an existing one you want to overhaul. We work with you to comprehend the objectives, audience, and the necessary functionalities and then convert the ideas into performing designs.</p>\n                <p>At WD Agency, great design starts with great planning, and our prototypes are the roadmaps to success of your product. We give you the ability to go from dream to actuality with assurance and with clear understanding by formalizing the design through the accurate visual representation and strategic design validation.</p>\n                    "}}]]}]]}]]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"],["$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"],"$L23"]}]
